4. Final Judgement
AI-generated tests are excellent scaffolding, but should always be reviewed.
Risks include:

Misinterpreting class behaviour

Missing edge cases

Overlooking persistence logic

In real projects, AI tests are a strong starting point, but human refinement is essential.